{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Witch and the Kitty's Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a linear adventure game perfect for casual relaxation. You'll play as a witch alongside a magical cat capable of transforming into a Cauldron. Together, you'll journey through various worlds, harness the power of spirits, vanquish monsters, gather ingredients, and complete the  Dream Soup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-ages friendly, simple controls! Anyone can enjoy the fun the game offers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing but still challenging! Understand various enemy attack patterns and dodge them stylishly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-drawn visuals! Immerse yourself in a fairy-tale world and adventure with your feline companion.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique level encounters! Each world offers different scenery and unique mechanics waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positive reinforcement guaranteed! Don't worry about the risk of failure; keep going and you will eventually reach your goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025260/extras/34e4f56e70c280a311213bd9f0d9f6a5.avif?t=1761782222\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The forest\u2019s sweetness in the air","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025260/612fd929647212742bafaed2c763422601940c2b.jpg"},{"name":"The ice\u2019s bite upon my tongue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4025260/576550be5352e371b05cf099dd0ba17bcd55c1bc.jpg"},{"n